# Who approves (playbook §1.2). With the "require review from code owners" rule on the protected branch,
# a PR touching these paths cannot be merged without the review of one of these people.
# Replace @<user-or-team>. The identity used by the agent (bot account or token) must NOT be listed here.
/docs/specs/   @<user-or-team>
/tests/        @<user-or-team>
/AGENTS.md     @<user-or-team>
/scripts/      @<user-or-team>
/.github/      @<user-or-team>
